About the Resort:
Welcome to your 5 star home in the heart of the Maldives, where days are long and sun-filled in a setting you’ll never forget. With 15 Food and Beverage Restaurant options and a whole host of experiences on offer, at Sun Siyam Iru Fushi, no two days are ever the same. Walk barefoot along the softest white sand and relax in our award-winning spa, or keep going until you find a spot so private, you’ll feel like you’ve discovered your own island. And for those looking for a more active holiday, we’ve got you covered with some of the best water sports in the Maldives. 


Use the app to help:
- Complete the check in registration requirements contactless;
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant tables, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving or spa treatments;
- view the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- view your bills that you might incur while at the resort;
- book your next stay at the resort.
